#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:121
msgid "FluentCart tracks three independent things: the order status, the payment status and the shipping status. You can add your own order and shipping statuses here, and rename the built-in ones."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:125
#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:216
